# Parser warning-count navigation

This file is non-executable navigation, not requirement or design authority.

## Scope

Expose a warning count while preserving diagnostics. See the authoritative [observable behavior](requirements.md#warning-count-behavior).

## Key decision

The count extends the existing result rather than adding a new diagnostics seam. See [parser result ownership](design.md#parser-result-seam).

## Execution and verification

Follow the compact [warning-count ticket](issues/01-warning-count.md), whose Done and verify section owns the executable observation command.
